{"title":"night sea psychic shadows","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/night-sea-psychic-shadows","date":1790053980000,"content":"<figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/38a26853-715c-4305-a193-90e9f15ea35e/nightsea3.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/38a26853-715c-4305-a193-90e9f15ea35e/nightsea3.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/38a26853-715c-4305-a193-90e9f15ea35e/nightsea3.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/38a26853-715c-4305-a193-90e9f15ea35e/nightsea3.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/38a26853-715c-4305-a193-90e9f15ea35e/nightsea3.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/38a26853-715c-4305-a193-90e9f15ea35e/nightsea3.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/38a26853-715c-4305-a193-90e9f15ea35e/nightsea3.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/38a26853-715c-4305-a193-90e9f15ea35e/nightsea3.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n          \n          <figcaption>\n            <p>painted: </p>\n          </figcaption>\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/tag/marseille\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>marseille</strong></a><strong> | visit my </strong><a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/journal/tag/sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>sketchbook</strong></a><strong> | more </strong><a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/visual-art\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>visual art</strong></a></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  <hr />\n  \n    \n\n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n \n\n\n  <p>during my long weeks in marseille, I walked by the sea at midnight — <em>and the ferris wheel, and the dwindling party people, and the gelato stations</em> — and felt comforted by the watery darkness, the sound of the waves, and my shadow drifting on the sand. </p><p>the sea painting is from memory, but on the right is a present-moment portrait of something inside of me: wormy, brain-twisty, gutteral, and smokey. it reminds me of something I wrote years ago: <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/lonely-work-is-swimming-in-the-ocean-alone\" target=\"_blank\"><em>ocean waters are psychic waters.</em> </a></p><p>I painted both of these during two evening time spell sessions — about 90 min each — in my weeks in berlin. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          <a href=\"null\">\n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/ad92a696-5693-4c2e-aca9-a149a9dec0f9/nightsea5.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/ad92a696-5693-4c2e-aca9-a149a9dec0f9/nightsea5.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/ad92a696-5693-4c2e-aca9-a149a9dec0f9/nightsea5.jpg?format=300w 300